WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.333
The copper fence rests on the near blue wheel. The grey cam turns with the dial.

00:00:01.333 --> 00:00:03.917
The pocket edge touches the brass tip. This is the resistance felt at the dial.

00:00:03.917 --> 00:00:06.500
The far gate lines up. The near rim still holds the fence at the same height, so the reading stays the same.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:09.083
The fence drops onto the middle wheel. The brass tip sits lower and meets the cam at a different dial reading.

00:00:09.083 --> 00:00:11.667
Moving the far wheel makes no difference while the fence rests on the middle wheel.

00:00:11.667 --> 00:00:12.917
The middle gate lines up. The far wheel is now the only one holding up the fence.

00:00:12.917 --> 00:00:15.500
The fence drops into all three gates. The lever nose fits into the cam pocket.

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:16.000
The turning cam pulls back the bolt.
